        <mxCell id="c235" value="&lt;b&gt;Security and operating notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• OCI NSGs allow only approved ingress/egress&lt;br&gt;• Passwords remain in session memory; no secrets in Git or SQLite&lt;br&gt;• Read-only default; policy + two-person approval for controlled changes&lt;br&gt;• AI creates proposals only; all requests pass schema, SQL and OEM authorization checks&lt;br&gt;• Schedules require an active authenticated session; OEM audit is authoritative" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#A8A8A8;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontColor=#161513;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
